# Response headers for the Cloudflare Pages deploy. Pages reads this file from
# the build output; nothing else serves it (the dev server ignores it).
#
# The safe set: nothing here restricts where scripts or media may load from, so
# nothing on the site can stop working. The full Content-Security-Policy
# allowlist (script-src, img-src, media-src against api./cdn.goyangi.pics,
# Google Fonts, Discord avatars) is a separate change that needs its own test
# round — the only CSP directive here is frame-ancestors, which stops other
# sites framing goyangi for clickjacking and has no bearing on what the page
# itself loads.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
